MetaWorld adaptations of published dynamic-horizon algorithms.
Changes: π0.5/LeRobot integration, Cartesian delta-action handling, serial
sampling, deterministic MetaWorld rollouts, and independent config/CLI modules.
See docs/dynamic_horizon_sources.md for exact source links and deviations.

